  "title": "Propose from-scratch K1 K2 K3 K4 with LR schedule comparison",
  "status": "planned",
  "doing": "Keep all fixed K1/K2/K3/K4 scratch arms in S4, crossed with constant, warmup+cosine-to-floor and KL-adaptive schedules, at least2 independent training seeds per cell. Match initialization within each replica, use fresh Adam and allowed seed streams, matched game-time horizons, and identity-bound scheduler checkpoint state. No cohort opening or launch authorized. Keep literature checklist choices explicit and frozen before scratch comparisons; do not assume warm-start improvements transfer or silently cross every checklist dimension.",
